<Base title="About & how we rank" description="How aiphonecompare ranks AI receptionists: independent, sourced, sponsored placements labeled."><h1>About aiphonecompare &amp; how we rank</h1>
<p>aiphonecompare is an independent directory of AI receptionists and voice agents. We are not owned by any vendor.</p>
<h2>How listings are ordered</h2><p>Tables are alphabetical. We do not score vendors yet. Sponsored listings may appear first and always carry a <span class="badge">Sponsored</span> label. Payment never changes a vendor's data.</p>
<h2>Where data comes from</h2><p>Every field comes from the vendor's own website or a cited third-party comparison, shown on each vendor page with a last-checked date. If we can't verify something, we leave it blank. We never guess prices.</p>
<h2>Corrections</h2><p>Vendors can request corrections; we update when we can verify the change.</p></Base>
